# The forms of the relative marker that agree with a month name, which is a
# masculine singular noun (Priberam: janeiro, fevereiro ... are listed as nome
# masculino). Only these close the year phrase of a part of a month as a lone
# trailing marker ("fin janvier dernier"); another form agrees with the word
# after it ("dernière minute", "pasada la fecha") and is left over. Invariant
# forms are kept.
passado
anterior
último
ultimo
próximo
proximo
que vem
seguinte
este
deste
neste
